  unitName: Mountain Sage Oguro
  unitId: 30595
  unitNumber: 915
  description: A demon once followed by many others of his kind who ruled over a
    large territory. A sage with ever growing power and influence, it was said that
    eventually he would come to rule the whole of Ishgria. However, thinking it all
    too boring, Oguro began to lose interest in all the demons who had pledged themselves
    to him. His only interest became the presence of a young demon who looked up
    to him, meaning to steal his wisdom.
  summonDesc: Ease is the braggarts' drive and that of those who dance for them.
    Their audience is no different.
  fusionDesc: What will you do after lusting for power? The only thing that awaits
    is meaningless fighting.
  evoDesc: Hear me, you superficial fool. Don't think you can grasp real strength
    outside the battlefield.
  element: 3
  rarity: 5
